\label{fig:mbr_replay_validation_std}
\end{figure}

\begin{figure}[!htbp]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{figs/mbr_replay_validation_f1/preview.pdf}
\caption{Replay and validation-gate ablation: F1. Source Average rows; full selected-set test F1. Only the latest common contiguous range, iterations 1–5, is plotted; no initial-test F1 is available for the refreshed runs. Both Enabled and Only Gate use refreshed RouterBSI runs, whereas Both Disabled and Only MBR retain their previous source runs; the four-series comparison therefore mixes source runs.}
